### ==============================================================================
### MockPulse - Exhaustive End-to-End Test Scenarios
### Run directly inside VS Code via the 'REST Client' extension
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. SYSTEM & HEALTH CHECK
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Root Info & Discovered Endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Health Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Internal Telemetry & P95/P99 Latency Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/_mockpulse/metrics
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 List All Loaded Mock Routes
GET {{baseUrl}}/_mockpulse/routes
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 Inspect Request History (Test Spy Assertion)
GET {{baseUrl}}/_mockpulse/history
Accept: application/json

### 1.6 Clear Request History Buffer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/_mockpulse/history
Accept: application/json

### 1.7 Universal CORS Preflight Check (OPTIONS)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/charge
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & BUSINESS REST ENDPOINTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Authenticate / Obtain JWT Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "test-client",
  "client_secret": "super-secret"
}

### 2.2 List Products Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Fetch Specific User (Path Parameter Extraction)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/usr_staff_42
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Create New Order (201 Created with Location Header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "prod_101",
  "quantity": 2,
  "customer_email": "engineer@antigravity.internal"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CHAOS & FAULT INJECTION SCENARIOS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Flaky Payment Gateway (25% Failure Rate with 503 & 250ms Delay)
# Send this request multiple times! ~1 out of 4 times it will return HTTP 503 with Retry-After.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ord_9901",
  "card_token": "tok_visa_valid"
}

### 3.2 Artificial Latency Jitter (300ms to 750ms Sleep)
# Simulates a slow, legacy external courier API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipping/rates
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Rate Limit Simulation (HTTP 429 Too Many Requests)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/third-party/rate-limited
Accept: application/json

### 3.4 Deterministic Chaos Crash (Always 500 Internal Error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chaos/crash
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. RFC HTTP COMPLIANCE & ERROR BOUNDARIES
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 RFC 405 Method Not Allowed (Expected 'Allow: GET')
POST {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4.2 RFC 404 Route Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/non-existent-service
Accept: application/json
